        <p>The $108,160.00 headline assumes 52 paid weeks. Unpaid time off, whether that is vacation without PTO, a seasonal gap, or a slow January, comes straight off the year. The take-home cost is bigger than the gross cost looks, because the weeks you lose are full-rate weeks:</p>
